<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2291] Notebook commit dropdown cut-off</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2291</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When you have a notebook under GIT version control, the dropdown with your commits will be cut-off with no possibility to scroll to older commits (see attached screenshot).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12859742/12859742_apache_zeppelin_commit_dropdown_cut_off.png&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
