&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/MyHammer/zeppelin&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/MyHammer/zeppelin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2291&quot; title=&quot;Notebook commit dropdown cut-off&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-2291&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-2291&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;-Commit-Dropdown-Scroll&lt;/p&gt;

